From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:51:01 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 174/202] Meridian: crash sweep fixes, Workbench icon, context
 menu test hook

Offers, side panel titles, reading mode in a background tab and the share
bubble without an anchor no longer crash Meridian's window. The Workbench's
favicon keeps its colours. --meridian-test-context-menu-command takes @file
(list / an id) so a test can walk every context menu item.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
